    "text": "6 hours ago TEXAS – May 2026 – Feeding Texas, the statewide network of food banks working to prevent hunger and ensure every Texan has reliable access to nutritious food, hosted a virtual press briefing today to outline major changes to the Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program (SNAP) under HR 1, known as the “One Big Beautiful Bill Act.” Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
